 .../bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8186-sys-clock.yaml  | 20 ++++-
 .../bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8188-clock.yaml      | 93 ----------------------
 .../bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8188-sys-clock.yaml  | 58 --------------
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 153 deletions(-)

